---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
---

<PublicLayout
  seo={{
    title: 'Shipping & Delivery Policy - Pan-India Express Dispatch | Teepul',
    description: 'Read the Teepul Shipping Policy. Free doorstep delivery on prepaid orders, direct dispatch from Panipat mills, real-time AWB tracking, and 2-5 day delivery across India.',
    canonicalUrl: '/shipping-policy',
  }}
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#f7f4ef] via-[#faf8f4] to-[#f4efe6] text-slate-900 overflow-hidden py-14 lg:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-amber-900/10">
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-amber-900/10 border border-amber-900/20 text-amber-900 text-xs font-black px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>🚚 Reliable Doorstep Logistics</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">
        Shipping & <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-800 via-amber-700 to-amber-900 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Delivery Policy</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Fast, insured, and transparent delivery direct from our Panipat manufacturing facility to your doorstep anywhere in India.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Highlight Cards -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 -mt-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md text-center space-y-1">
        <div class="text-2xl">📦</div>
        <div class="font-black text-slate-900 text-sm">Free Delivery</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">On all prepaid orders nationwide</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md text-center space-y-1">
        <div class="text-2xl">⚡</div>
        <div class="font-black text-slate-900 text-sm">24-48 Hr Dispatch</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Shipped direct from Panipat mills</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md text-center space-y-1">
        <div class="text-2xl">📍</div>
        <div class="font-black text-slate-900 text-sm">Pan-India Reach</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">All 28 States & 8 Union Territories</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Shipping Policy Content -->
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 space-y-10 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">1.</span> Direct Mill Dispatch & Fulfillment Center
        </h2>
        <p>
          Unlike retail intermediaries who store products in third-party warehouses, every order placed on <strong>Teepul</strong> is tailored, inspected, packaged, and dispatched directly from our central manufacturing unit in:
        </p>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-800">
          <strong>Teepul Central Fulfillment Center</strong><br />
          Plot No. 142, Sector-25, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Phase-2,<br />
          Panipat, Haryana – 132103, India.
        </div>
        <p>
          Direct-from-mill shipping eliminates warehouse handling damage, protects fresh fabric textures, and ensures you receive the newest production stock.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">2.</span> Delivery Coverage & Regional Timelines
        </h2>
        <p>
          We deliver to over 19,000+ pin codes across all 28 states and 8 union territories in India. Estimated delivery times from the date of dispatch:
        </p>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden text-xs">
            <thead class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-bold">
              <tr>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-slate-200">Destination Region</th>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-slate-200">Coverage Areas</th>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-slate-200">Estimated Delivery Time</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Delhi-NCR & Northern Hubs</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-slate-600">Delhi, Gurugram, Noida, Chandigarh, Jaipur, Lucknow</td>
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-amber-800">1 to 3 Business Days</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Metro Cities & Tier 1</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-slate-600">Mumbai, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai, Kolkata, Pune, Ahmedabad</td>
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-amber-800">2 to 4 Business Days</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Tier 2 & Tier 3 Cities</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-slate-600">State capitals and major district headquarters across India</td>
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-amber-800">3 to 6 Business Days</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">Northeast, J&K, & Islands</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-slate-600">Assam, Meghalaya, Jammu & Kashmir, Andaman & Nicobar</td>
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-amber-800">5 to 8 Business Days</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">3.</span> Shipping Charges
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li><strong>Prepaid Orders:</strong> We offer <strong>FREE express doorstep shipping</strong> on all prepaid orders (UPI, Paytm PG, Razorpay, Debit/Credit Cards, Net Banking) with zero hidden delivery charges.</li>
          <li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD) Orders:</strong> A nominal courier handling fee of ₹49–₹99 may apply at checkout to cover secure cash-collection logistics.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">4.</span> Courier Partners & Order Tracking
        </h2>
        <p>
          We partner with leading Indian logistics carriers to ensure timely transit, including:
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 py-1">
          <span class="bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">EKart Logistics</span>
          <span class="bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">Blue Dart Express</span>
          <span class="bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">Delhivery</span>
          <span class="bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">DTDC</span>
          <span class="bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">India Post Speed Post</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          Within 24 hours of parcel dispatch, you will receive an SMS, WhatsApp message, and email containing your live Air Waybill (AWB) tracking number and direct courier tracking link.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">5.</span> Delivery Attempts & Non-Delivery (RTO)
        </h2>
        <p>
          Our courier partners make up to <strong>3 delivery attempts</strong> before returning a parcel to our Panipat hub. In case you miss a delivery attempt:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li>The courier will contact your phone via call or automated IVR.</li>
          <li>You may reschedule delivery for a preferred date directly with the delivery agent or contact our care desk at <a href="mailto:support@teepul.com" class="text-amber-800 hover:underline font-bold">support@teepul.com</a>.</li>
          <li>Ensure your shipping address includes a complete house/street number, recognizable landmark, and valid 6-digit pin code.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</PublicLayout>
